    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/0def1644f47562b262cfee1e9a0d377c.avif?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/7c812cfaad1c591b56c696eb5ada4cd6.webp?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ad4b46e2615be72607cf29ce81f44714.poster.avif?t=1720520604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ad4b46e2615be72607cf29ce81f44714.webm?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ad4b46e2615be72607cf29ce81f44714.mp4?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Quest for Gold you control squads of knights and archers to defend your castle from attacking waves of Goblins. They will attack you with various weapons such as TNT throwers, flame-torches and even exploding barrels. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/10677fd9b6264cce128eb69af0542558.webp?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/c945cf0c45c1944a95a2baea177b6cd6.poster.avif?t=1720520604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/c945cf0c45c1944a95a2baea177b6cd6.webm?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/c945cf0c45c1944a95a2baea177b6cd6.mp4?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your troops are grouped into squads of multiple units. This way you can easily position your troops to block the Goblins from reaching your castle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/5d2fe83aa76be717e23caa3c51efc77d.webp?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ea14cd5f2ef24d1e33d009c4d93b2335.poster.avif?t=1720520604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ea14cd5f2ef24d1e33d009c4d93b2335.webm?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ea14cd5f2ef24d1e33d009c4d93b2335.mp4?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Whenever you've defeated a Goblin wave you will be given a choice of strategic resources to use. Replace squad losses or build towers to prepare for the next wave.<br><br><i>Gold Rush! Expeditions are sent from all parts of the realm to new found lands where vast mines of gold have been discovered. The king has sent you on a quest to go to these lands and participate in the gold rush. Will you be able to mine the gold or will the Goblin threat prove too tough?</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/0def1644f47562b262cfee1e9a0d377c.avif?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/7c812cfaad1c591b56c696eb5ada4cd6.webp?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ad4b46e2615be72607cf29ce81f44714.poster.avif?t=1720520604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ad4b46e2615be72607cf29ce81f44714.webm?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ad4b46e2615be72607cf29ce81f44714.mp4?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Quest for Gold you control squads of knights and archers to defend your castle from attacking waves of Goblins. They will attack you with various weapons such as TNT throwers, flame-torches and even exploding barrels. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/10677fd9b6264cce128eb69af0542558.webp?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/c945cf0c45c1944a95a2baea177b6cd6.poster.avif?t=1720520604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/c945cf0c45c1944a95a2baea177b6cd6.webm?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/c945cf0c45c1944a95a2baea177b6cd6.mp4?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your troops are grouped into squads of multiple units. This way you can easily position your troops to block the Goblins from reaching your castle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/5d2fe83aa76be717e23caa3c51efc77d.webp?t=1720520604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ea14cd5f2ef24d1e33d009c4d93b2335.poster.avif?t=1720520604\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ea14cd5f2ef24d1e33d009c4d93b2335.webm?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428520/extras/ea14cd5f2ef24d1e33d009c4d93b2335.mp4?t=1720520604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Whenever you've defeated a Goblin wave you will be given a choice of strategic resources to use. Replace squad losses or build towers to prepare for the next wave.<br><br><i>Gold Rush! Expeditions are sent from all parts of the realm to new found lands where vast mines of gold have been discovered. The king has sent you on a quest to go to these lands and participate in the gold rush. Will you be able to mine the gold or will the Goblin threat prove too tough?</i>",
    "short_description": "Quest for Gold is a charming real-time tactics game. Defend your kingdom against increasingly difficult waves of Goblin attackers with relaxed squad-based controls. Mine gold to reach a high score or spend precious time building up your defenses in-between waves.",
